<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">Marqqossa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marqqossa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xamaqiza Yanisa markateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossa na Yesus Kirstosa koyro mishirachoy hayssa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nabe Isayasa bagara “Hekko ness ogge lo7othanade ta kitana urra ta neeppe sinthara yedana <verse number="3" style="v"/>Godas ogge gigisite izi baana ogge sit histi othite, gishe bazo bitan wasiza gireth” geteti xafetides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hesathokka xamaqiza Yanisay asa xaamaqishenne “inte nagarappe simmidi xammaqettitte, Xoossi inte nagara atto gaana” gi elishe bazora kezi wodhides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yihuda derey kumeth Yerusalame asay wuri Yanisakko bi bidi ba nagara nagara paaxxi paaxxi Yordanose shaafan Yanisa kushen xammaqetidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>He wode Yanisay mayzay gamela ithikkeppe othetida mayo, dabba dafora dances, miza qummay bollene degera eessa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Izi “tani hokkada iza camma qasho birshanas besontadey tappe adhizadey tappe guyera yana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tani intena hathan xammaqays izi gidikko intena Xillo Ayanan xammaqana gidi sabakidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa Xamaqetethine paceteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>He wode yesusay Galila garsan diza Nazrete getetiza katamayppe Yordanose shaafa yidi Yanisa kushen xamaqetidees <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesusay xamaqetidi Hathafe kezida mala saloy doyetin Xillo Ayanay izza bolla wolle kafo milatidi wodhishin beyidees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Qassekka ta dosiza nay nena; nenan ta ufayistays giza qaala girethi pude salora setetidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Herakka Xillo Ayanay izza duge bazo kalethidi efidees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hen banzonkka oyduu tammu galas gakanas Xal7aera pacetishe gam7idees. Do7atara issippe deyidees, kitanchatikka iza madida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yeusaya mole oykiza oyduu asata bena kalana mala xeygidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>Yansay qasho keth gelidaysappe guye Yesusay Xoossa mishiracho qaala sabakishe gede Galila biidi “Wodey gakidess; Xoossa kawoteth matides; nagarape simitte, mishracho qalan amanite” giidi sabakidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesusay Galila abba achara adhishin Simonayne iza isha Indirasay mole oykizayta gidida gish isti mole oykiza gite aban yegishin be7ides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusay ista hayte tana kalitte inte mole oykii shisiza mala ass oykizayta histana gides. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Isti herakka mole giteza yegi agidi Yesusa kaallida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Guthu gede sinthe adhidi Zabidosa naa Yaqobene iza isha Yanisay wogolon utidi mole gite gigisishin beydine herakka ista xeygidees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Istika ba aawa Zabidosas qaxaretidi othiza asatara issippe wogoloza gidon agidi Yesusa kaallidi bida.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuna ayanay iza bolla dizde Yesusay pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Heppekka Qifirnahomme bida. Herakka Yesusay Ayhudata sanbata galas Ayhudata wossa keth gelidi tamarso oykidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Xafista mala gidonta godatethara diza asa mala izi tamarasin asay wuri iza timirtezan malaletidees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>He wode Ayhudata wosa keeththan diza tuna ayanay iza bolla diza issi adey <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nazirete Yesusa ne nuppe azi koyay? Nuna dhaysana yadi? Ne oonakone ta nena erays, neni Xoossa gesha” gidi wasidees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuasakka tunna ayanaza “co7u gada izappe keza” giidi hanqidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tuna ayanay addeza gendersidi izi qaketishin izappe wasishe kezidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Derey wuri “asso haysi aza pala? Haysi godatethara diza oratha timirtekko! Tunna ayanatakka azazes istikka izas azazetetes” gi malaletishe asay ba garsan issay issa oychecho oykides. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Herakka iza otho worey kumeth Galila yushon diza dere wuruson siyetidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay daro harganchata pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ayhudata wossa kethafe kezida mala Yaqoberanne Yanisara issippe gede Simonasone Indiriyasaso gelida. <verse number="30" style="v"/>He gelidamalakka Simona bolotiya micha harge sakistada zini7idaysa izas yotida. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesusay izikko shiqidi izi kushe oykidi denthidees. Michay agin iza dendada ista mokkadus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Away wuldappe guye gadey dhumishin asay harganchatane daydanthi oykida asa wursi Yesusakko ekki yidees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>He katamayn diza asay wuri keeththa karen shiqides. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Izikka dumma dumma hargen saketidayta darota pathidees. Daro daydanthatakka kesidees. Gido atin daydanthati Yesusay oonakone eriza gish daydanthati hasa7ana mala Yesusay koybeyna.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Galilan mishracho qaala tamarsides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Sosey zon7onta malado wontara Yesusay dendidi issi pashka so biidi hen wossa oykidees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simonayne izara dizayti Yeusa koyana kezi bida. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Isti iza demidi assi wuri nena koshan dees gida. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “ta yiday tamarsanas gidida gish anne mishracho qaala yootanas matan diza gutata boss” gidees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hesa gish Ayhudata wossa keeththan geli geli sabakishene daydanth kesishe Galila kumethan yuyidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay inchiracha hargizade pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Issi inchiracha hargizadey Yesusakko shiqidine iza sinthan gulbatidi “koykko ne tana pathana danda7asa” gi wossidees. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesusaykka adezas michetidi ba kushe yedi iza bochidine “ta ne paxanamala koyays paxa” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Herakka adeza inchiracha hargey agin, adezi paxidees. <verse number="43-44" style="v"/>Yesuaykka addezas “onaskka hayssa ne hasa7onta mala nagista, giddo atin bada qesses nena bessa, derezas markka gidana mala ne paxidaysas Mussey azazida yarshoza shisha” gidi kehi minth yotidees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Gido atin adezi kezi biidi ba bida wurso son wore darsi dharcidees. Hessa gedon Yesusay awa katamankka qoncera gelanas danda7ibeyna. Hessafe dendidaysan katamappe karera assi baynda son dusu oykidees. Assay gidikko awappe awappekka izakko yidees.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay to sila adde pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Gutha galasafe guye “Yesusay guye Qifirnahome simidi soon dees” giza wore asay siyidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessa gish kethara karera utizasoy dhayana gakanas daro derey shiqidees. Izikka Xoossa qaala asas sabakidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Oydu ass dayti issi toy silida ass tokidi izakko ehida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Assa darotethafe dendidaysan Yesusay dizaso gathanas danda7onta gish Yesusay diza ginara kaara lukidi harganchaza izi zin7ida zaphara Yesusa sinth duge wothida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesusay asata amano beydi toy silida adeza “hayso ne nagaray maretidees” gides. <verse number="6-7" style="v"/>Hen gadan utida issi issi Musse woga Xahaaththaeti ba wozinara haysi addezi wosti hayssatho gizee? Xoossa bolla casha qaala hasa7eskko! issi Xoossafe atin nagara marana danda7izay onne gidi qopida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesusay herakka isti ba wozinan qopidaysa ba ayanan eridi “inte wositi hayssatho qoppetii? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Toy silidadeza ne nagaray maretidees gusafenne dendada ne zapha tokkada ba gusafe aways kawushee? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gido atin asa nass bitta bollan agara marana godatethi dizaysa inte erana mala” gidi to silla addeza <verse number="11" style="v"/>“dendada ne tokkista yida zaphe tokkada ne soo ba” gidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Izikka dendidi asay wuri beyshin zapha tokidi bidees. Hen gadan diza asay wurii hanozan malaletidi “Haysa malay hanini beybekko” gidi Xooss galatidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Lewe xeygides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qasekka Yesusay Galila abba lanqe yides. Daro dereykka izakko yin izikka yida asa tamarsides. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Izi oogera adhi bishin Elifiyosa na Leewy qaraxa shishizason utidaysa beydine “haya tana kaalla” gidees, izkka dendidi Yesusa kalidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hesafe guye leewe son kaththa madan uti dishin qaraxa shishiza daro asatinne nagaranchati izara kali yida gish issti Yesusaranne iza kalizaytara issife kaththa madan utida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Parsawista bagafe gidida Musse woga tamarsizayti Yesusay nagaranchataranne qaraxa shishizaytara mishin beydi iza kalizayta “Qaraxxa shishizaytaranne nagaranchatara aazas mizee?” giidi oychida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusaykka isti gizaysa siyidi “Akimmey harganchatas koshes atin hargontaytas gidena. Takka nagaranchata xeyganas yadis attin xillota xeyganas yabeykke gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoomma gish shiqida oycha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yanisa kalizatinne Parsaweti xomma xommetes. Issi issi asati Yesusakko yidi Yanisa kalizaytinne Parsawista kalizayti xommetees. Nena kalizayti azass xommetene gi oychida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas mishiray istara dishin mishira lageti xommi erizo? Mishiray istara dishin xommi eretena. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mishiray isstappe ekistana wodey yana he wode issti xommana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gal7a mayo bolla oratha curqa wothi sikizadey onnikka deenna, hessaththo othikko orathazi gal7a dakki dakki yeges; dakethaykka kassefe gede adhi ites. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessathokka oratha woyne caje gal7a ogoron wothizadey denna. Wothiza gidikko woynne cajezi gal7a ogoroza dhuses, woynne cajezine ogorazi namm7ay moretetes. Hessa gish oratha woynne cajey danas besizay oratha oogorana” gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Sanbata gish shiqida oycho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusay Ayhudata sanbata galas gistte tiya gidora adhishin iza kalizayti izara issippe bishe tiya xupho oykkida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Parsaweti “Nena kalizayti sanbata galas digetida miish aazas othizo? gidi Yesusa oychida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Izikka istas “Dawitey gafidi mizaz koyda wode izara issippe dizaytara izi othidaysa nababibeyketii? gidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Abiyatarey qessista halaqatethan dishin izi Xoossa keth gelidi qeseti xalala manas besiza dumma kaththa bess midine benara dizaytas immidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Qassekka sambaytas asas medhetidees atin assi sanbatas medhetibeyna. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta asa nay sambata goda. gides.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusay Kushey silida addeza pathides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hara galas Mukurabe gelidees, henikka kushey silida uray dees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iza motanas gasso koyza asati izi Ayhudata sambata galas pathankkonne gidi pathishin beyana koyda. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izikka ha kushey silida addeza “shiqi utidda asa sinthan denda eqqa” gidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesusay asa “sambata galas besizay lo7o othoye ita othoo? Assa shemmpo aashoye woykko shemppo wodho? gidi oychidees. Isstikka coo7u gida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Istta wozina shuchatethan michetidi izza giddothidi yuyi adhi eqida asa hanqora eqidi addeza “Ne kushe pidisa” gidees. Addezikka ba kushe pidisin kushezi mulera pathidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Parsaweti kezi bidi iza wosti dhaysanakkone Herdossa baga gidida asatara zoretida.</para>
  <para style="s">Abba lanqen daro asay Yesusakko shiqidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesusay bena kalizata abbako bidees. Galilappenne Yudappe yida daro derey iza kalidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Izi othizaysa siyidi asay Yudapppe, Yerusalemppe, Edomasappe, Yordanose pinthan diza dereyppe qasse Xirosappene Siddona herappe izakko yidees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Asay darida gish iza kun7isonta mala gutha wogolo issti gigisana mala bena kalizayta azazidees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Izi darota harganchata pathida gish sakkoy waysizayti wurii iza ba kushera bochanas dafetidees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tuna ayanatikka iza be7ida mala iza sinthan kundidi “Neni Xoossa na” gishe wasida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gido atin izi oonakone tuna ayanati qoncisontamala kehippe hanqidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuay bena kaliza tamane nammata doridees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yeusay pudde zumma bolla kezidi ba koyzayta bekko yana mala xeygidees, isttikka izakko yida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Izara issippe gidana malanne sabakanas yedana mala tamane namm7ata Hawarista gis sunthidees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Assappe daydanthata kessana mala istasi godateth imidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Izi sunthida tammane nam7ata sunthi hayssappe kalizaysa; Phixirosa getetida Simmona, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bo7ornegesse woykko dada nayta getetida Zabidossa nayta Yaqobene Yanisa, <verse number="18" style="v"/>Indirasa, Philiphosa, Bertelemossa, Mattossa, Tommasa, Ilposa na Yaqobbe, Tadossa, ba bittas zil7etiza Simmona, <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesusa athi immida Asqorotu Yudda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusane Bi7el zebulla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessappe guye Yesusay issi so gelidees. Izine iza kalizayti kath mana wodey istas dhayana gakanas derey qassekka dari shiqidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iza hanota siyida iza daboti gooyonta agena gidi benara ekki banas izi dizaso gakida. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yerusalameppe Yida Xafetikka Bi7el zebula betetiza daydanthata halaqay iza bolla dees, izi daydanthata kesizay daydanthata halaqa wolqana gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Izikka ista xeygidi lemusora, “Xala7y asappe Xal7e wosti kesanne?” gidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Be garsan shakkoy diza kawotethi minanas danda7ena. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Issi ketha assikka ba garasan shaketikko eqanas danda7ena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessathokka Xala7ey ba garasan issay issara shaketikkonne eqanas shakkoy dikko mini eqanas danda7ena, hesikka izas wurseth gidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessa gason issi uray koyrotidi wolqamara ura qashonta dishe wolqamazaso gelanasine iza mishe bonqanas danda7ena, Ketha mishe bonqanas danda7etizay wolqama ura qachikko xala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta intess tumu gays asa naytas nagaraynne cashi wuri matistana, <verse number="29" style="v"/>gido attin Xillo ayana bolla casha qaala hasa7iza asa wursoso medhinas nagara aco gidana atin medhinaskka maristana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessa izi giday isstti iza “Ne bolla tunna ayanay dees” gidaysa gishasa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa ayiyone iza ishata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessappe guye iza ayiyanne iza ishati yidinne karen eqidi asse izakko kitidi xeygisida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Iza yuyi adhi utidda daro asay “Hekko ne ayiyanne ne ishati karen eqidi nena koyetees” gida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Izikka zaridi ta aya onne? ta ishatichi onanitte? gidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Iza yui utidda asakko xelidi “ta ayanne ta ishati haytantakko” gidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Xoossa shene othizay wuri izi ta isha, ta michchone, ta ayo” gidees.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Zereth zerizade lemmuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hara wode qasse abba achan tamarso oykidees, izakko daro derey shiqidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izikka daro yota lemuson hizgi tamarsidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Siyitte issadey kath zeranas kezidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Izi zershin issi issi zerethi oogge bolla wodhidees. Oogge bolla wodhida zeretha kafoti maxi mida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Baggay lo7o biittay baynda mela biittan wodhides shin bittay mela gidida gish herakka caridees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido atin away kezida mala shulidees. Xapho yedonta gish melidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Qasse issi zerethi handay aguntha gidon wodhidees agunthaykka dicidi culida gish ayfibeyna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hara zerethi qasse lo7o orde biitta bolla wodhidagish caridi dicidees ayfekka ayfidees; issa hezu tammu, issay qasse usuppun tammu, hara issay qasse xettu ayfidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesusay qassekka siyiza haythi diza uray siyo gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesosay Lemusora Yotiza Gaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Izi berkka dishin tammane namm7atinne kasse izara diza asay izi yotida lemusoza gish iza zari oychida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izikka istas intes Xoossa kawotetha xuray gelidees shin karen dizaytas gidikko yoyi wuri lemusora yotetees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessikka kasse “istti beydi be7idaysa akekontamalanne istti simontamala, qassekka ista nagaray maretonta malasa gedees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qssekka Yesusay hiz gidees “Haysi lemusoy intess gelibeyne? Histin hara lemuso inte wosti eranne? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Zeretha zeriday qaala zeres <verse number="15" style="v"/>Issi issi asati ogge bolla wodhida zeretha mala, issti qaala siyiza wode Xala7ey yidi herakka istti siyida qaala issta wozinappe ekki gidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessakko harati mela biitta bolla wodhida zeretha milatetees. Istti qaka siyidi ufaysara eketess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Gido attin issti xappo yedonta gish gutha wode gam7ishin qaala gedon metoy woykko godistay asata bolla yiza wode herakka dhuphetetees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Harati qasse aguntha gidon wodhida zeretha milatetees, issti qalla sisi siyetees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gido atin ha biitta metoynne misha pacehnne hara amoy issiti siyida qaala culidi ayfe ayfonta mala digees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hankoyta lo7o biittan zaretidda zeretha milatetees, heytikka qaala siyidi ekizadene hezu tammu, ayfe usuppun tammu ayfene xetu ayfe ayfizayta.</para>
  <para style="s">Gemman diza xomppe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Qassekka hizgdeess “Xomppe oythidi gemason woykko arssa garsan wothi ereti? Po7ana mala qonceson wothista giddene? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gish qotetidi qoncen kezontay po7on kezonta gemman attanay bawa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessa gish siyiza haythi dizadey siyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Gujidikka inte siyizaysa wozinan wothite inte maqiza mishara intess makkistana hessappe daroy gujettana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Dizades gujistanashin bayndadefe izas dizarakka ekkistana gidana gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Diciza zeretha lemmuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qssekka hizgidees “Xoossa kawotethi zereth zeriza issi ura milataysu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Zeridadey ommars zin7es wontishin dendees, gido attin izi eronta dishin zaretida kaththay mokidi culidees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Gadeyka koyro carecha kalethada buxxa buxxappe kalethada buxxa bolla lo7o ayfe immadus. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kathay kaxidappe guye boney gakin ketha aaway herakka matha oykkes.</para>
  <para style="s">Sanafice getetiza akakilte ayfe lemmuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Qassekka hiz gidees “Xoossa kawoteth nu azara ginisi beyane? azara lemusane? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Biitta bolla wursofe lafa gidida sanafice ayfe milataysu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sanafice ayfey santha ayfe mala gutha ayfe. </char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Zeristada dicidappe guye qass akakiltista wursofe adhiza gish kafoti yidi he akakiltey hangista kuwa gidon shempetees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesusaykka asay ekanas danda7izaysa kena hayta milatiza hara daro lemusora istas yotides. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Aymish gidikkokka asas lemusoy baynda yoti erena. Izinne iza kalizayti xala dizawode gidikko wurssi birsh yootes. <verse number="35" style="v"/>He galas gadey qamishin bena kalizayta “anne gede he pinth piinos” gides. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Issti asa hen agagidi izi uti diza wogolozara Yeussa ekki bidda. Hara wogolotikka istara isife detes. <verse number="37" style="v"/>He wode wolqama bulahey abba bolla dendidi wogoloza hathi kummana gakanas bulahey shocechidees. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesusay borkoth borkotidi wogolozas guye bagan zin7idees. Isstikka iza denthidi “astamare nuni wurshin nena metene” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Izikka dendidid carkoza “Coo7u ga”, abbakka “woppu ga” gides, carkoykka co7u sirphi gidees, mullekka co7udees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Bena kalizaytakka “Haysatho aazas babideti? hayssa gakanas intess ammanoy bayee?” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Issttikka kehi babidi ba garsan issay issara “caarkkoynne abbay izass azazetizay haysi onnee?” getetida.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay issi tunna ayanay iza bolla dizade pathidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Abba pinidi gede Gergesene getetizaso bida <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesusay wogoloyppe wodhida mala tunna ayanay izza bolla dizadey dufosoppe kezidi Yesusara gagana izako yides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Haysi adezi dufoson dizadene oonikka iza haray atoshin sansalatara qachanas danda7ibeyna. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Daro wode to birataranne sansalatara qachetees. Gido atin kushe sansalata duthethi yeges, too biratakka mentherethi yeges, oonikka iza oykidi teqanas danda7ibeyna. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Galasine qamma dufota gidoninne zummata bolla yuyi yuyi wasishe ba bolla shuchara qanxerethes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Izikka Yesusa hahon be7idamala wothan izakko yidi iza sinthan gulbatidi goynidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kehi wassidi “Hayso woogga Xoossa na Yesusa nees tanara azi dizee? Xoossa sunthan ta nena wosays tana waysoppa gidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Izi hessa giday Yesusay kasse neni tunna ayanay hayssafe keza gida gishasa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessafe qasse Yesusay iza ne sunthi oone gidi oychidees. Izikka nuni darota gidida gish ta sunthi Legewone getetes gidees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Legowoney 6000 wotadaratas imetiza suntha.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>He dereppe kessi yedonta mala Yesusa kehi wosidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hen matan zumma bolla daro gudunthi heemetes. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tunna ayanati nu gudunthatan gelanamala nuss ero garkki gidi Yesusa wosida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Izikka istas ero gidees. Tunna ayanatikka adezappe kezidi gudunthatan gelida. Namm7u shi gidida gudunthay wurii aafozara dugetha gendereti wodhidi wurikka abban mitettidees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Guduntha hemizayti baqatidi hanidaysa katamaninne dere garsan yotida. Dereykka hanidaysa beyanas ba dizasoppe dizasoppe kezidees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesusaykka yidi daro daydanth iza bolla dizadez wozinay izas simin mayo maydinne woggara utidaysa yida asay beydi babidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Haysa be7ida asay daydanthi iza bolla dizadeza gishinne gudinthati hanoysa derezas yotida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessafe guye he dere asay Yesusay ista dere yedidi bana mala wossidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesusay wogolon gelishin daydanthati izappe kezida uray Yesusara danas wosidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesusay qasse izi oychidaysa akkayo gidine “Neni gede ne so ba, Goday ness ay mala gita miish othidakkonne izi ness othida marotetha ne soo asas yota” gides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Adezikka ba so biidi Yesuusay izas othida gita miish wursi tammu katamma getetiza deren yotin siyiday wurikka malaletidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesusay qassekka wogolon gelidi gede pinth pinidi abba achan dishin daro asay iza ach shiqidinne iza gidothides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mukirabe halaqatappe issay Iya7irosa getetizaysi izi dizaso bidi Yesusa demida mala iza to bolla kundidi <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tass gutha naa dizara hayqana gaysu iza hayqonta paxa dana mala ne ha yada ne kushe izi bolla wotharki gidi kehi wosides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesusaykka izara issippe bidess. Daro asay iza kun7ana gakanas kaalidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tammane nam7u layth kumethi suthi izi bollafe gukiza macasha dizara hen asara daysu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iza bess diza miish ubbaa wursana gakanas akimeppe akime lamon daro daburadus. Gido atin sakoy izis gede daridees atin ayinne keybeynna. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iza Yesusa gish siyidamala asa gidora Yesusa guyera kalada iza mayo bochaduss. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Gassoykka ta ay hanadakka iza mayo kushera bocho bochizakkokka ta paxana gada qopida gishasa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Gukiza suthay herakka eqi agidees, izakka paxidaysa ba asatethan eradus. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Beppe wolqay kezidaysa Yesusay eriidi gede asakko simidi “Ta mayo oone bochiday?” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iza kalizayti qasse haysi derey kun7etidi sugetishin beyashe wanada &lt;tana bochiday oonne?&gt; gay gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesusay hessa othiday oonakkone beyanas yushi xelidees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Macashayakka bess azi wanidakkone erada babashene kokorashe yada Yesusa sinthan gufanada hanida tumma wurssa izas yotaduss. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Izikka “ta naaye ne amonoy nena ashides Saron ba, ne wayeppe paxa” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesusay buro hasa7a bolla dishin mukurabe halaqa Iya7irosa soppe yidi Iya7irosas “ne naaya hayqaduss, Goda mela aazas dabursaz?” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Gidikkokka Yesusay issta hasa7a lepp histidi mukurabe halaqaza “Ne amano xala ammana atin baboppa” gidees. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pixirosa Yaqoberane Yaqobe isha Yanisappe atin haray oonikka iza kalana mala koybeyna. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Gede mukurabe halaqa keth gakidamala asay wasishe cammo yeho yekizaysa beyidees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>So gelidi haysi wuri aza wasonne aaza yeho? Naya dhiskadus atin hayqabeyku gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Qassse asay wuri iza bolla bicidees asa wursikka kethappe kesidi nayi aawane nayi ayiyo qassekka izara issippe yidayta iza kalizayta xala kalethidi naya diza so gelidees. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nayi kushekka ooykidi “Xaalita kum!” gidees. “Xaalita kum” gusas birshechi hane naye denda guussa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nayakka herkka denda eeqadus, hene hane hamutaduss. Iziskka laythay tammanne namm7u laytha; asaykka he hanozan daro malaletides. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesusay hayssa oonikka eronta mala kehi minthi yotidees; “nays mana qumma immitte” gides.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nazirete asay Yesusa moki ekkibeytena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesusay heppe dendidi gede ba dere bidees. Iza kalizaytikka izara bida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ayhudata sambatay gakin Ayhudata wossa keth gelidi tamarsishin siyida asay malaletishe hiz gidees “Hayssi adezi hayssa wursi aawappe eekidee? haysi izas immetida eratethay aze? qasse hayti izi othiza malatati wani iza kushen hanizo? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Haysi anaxeza gidenee? Marami na Yaqobenta Yosofonta, Yihudantane Simonanta isha gidene? Iza micheti nunara han nu matan dizayta detene? Giidi hessafe dendidaysan izan ufa7etibetena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesusaykka isstas “Nabey bonchetontay ba deren ba dabota gidonine ba so asa achan xala” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hen gutha harganchata bolla kushe wothi pathorippe attin hara aykko malatakka oothanas danda7ibeynna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Isstas ammanoy bayndaysa beyidi malaletidees. Hessafekka Yesusay mandarappe mandaran yuyi yuyi tamarsides.</para>
  <para style="s">Bena Kaliza tammane namm7ata Yesusay kittidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tammane namm7ata beekko xeygidi namm7u namm7u histi kitishe tunna ayanata bolla isstas godateth immidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Izi “ogges gidiza gufe attin oogge shinqe woykko qaraxite woykko mishshe oykoppitte. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Caamma athitte gido attin lammana mayo oykopitte. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Issi keth inte gelikko he katammappe inte kezana gakanas he kethan diitte. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Awankka oonikka intena mokki eekonta ixxikko heppe kezishe he dereta bolla marka gidanamala inte to bolla diza gudula qoqofitte” gidi azazides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Isstikka heeppe kezidi derey marotethan gelana maal sabakida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Daro daydanthata kesida daro harganchata zayte tiyi tiyidi pathida.</para>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiza Yanisa hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesusa sunthi kassefe ereti ereti bishin kawo Herodossay hessa siyidees. Issi issi asati “hayssa mala malatata othiza Xamqiza Yanisay hayqoppe dendina” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bagayti “Elasakko gida” baga asay qasse “kasse nabetappe issa mala” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Herodosay yoza siyidi “ta iza qodhe qanxisida Yanisay hayqoppe paxxi dendidees” gidees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Herodossay ba isha Pilipossa machcho Herodiyado ekkida gedon oyketidi qacheelotana mala azazidi yanisa qasho keth gelithidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yanisay Herodosa “ne isha machcho ne ekontamala wogay nena diges” gida gish qachides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Herodiyaday hessa gish holotada iza wodhisanas koyadus shin danda7abeykku. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gasoykka Yanisay xillo ass gididaysa Herodosay eriza gish Yanisas babesine iza naages. Yansay yotizaysa Herodosay siydi hirgizagidikokka izzi yotizaysa wozinappe siyes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Herodosa yeleta galas bonchanas dhoqa shuumistas olla wotadarata azaziza wanatasine Galila biittan kehi eretiza gitta asatas gibira kesidees, hesikka Herodiyadis gigga galas gididees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Herodiyadi maca naaya gelada asa sinthan yeth yexin Herodosane izi xeygida asa izi yethay ufaysidees. Kawoykka nayo “ne koyiza miish ubbaa tana oycha ta ness immana” gides. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Qassekka ta kawotetha baga gididakkokka ne oychikko wurssa taa neess immana gidi iziss caqidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nayakka elela kezada ba ayeyo “kawo azi oychchoo?” gadus. Ayiyakka “Xammaqiza Yanisa hu7e qanxada imma ga” gadus. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nayakka elela kezada kawozakko gelada “xamaqiza Yanisa hu7e keren wothada ne tass immana mala koyayis” ga oychadus. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kawoy he yozan daro handatidees, gido attin xeygetida immatha gishine caqida qalla gish iziss akaye ganas koybeyna. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessa gish wotadaratappe issa eesson kitidi Yansa qodhe qanxidi iza hu7e eki yana mala azazidees, izikka biidi qasho ketha gidon Yanisa qodhe qanxides. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hu7eza sanera ehidi nayes immidees, naykka ba ayeyis immadus. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yanisa kalizaytikka hessa siyida mala yidi Yanisa anha ekki efidi mogida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ichachu shi dere muzudees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hesafe guye kitetidayti simidi Yesusa achan yuyi adhidi ba othidaysanne ba tamarsidaysa wursi izas yotida. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Daro asay yishenne bishe giza gish qumma miza wodeykka deybeyna, “Anne inte xala tanara poqethaso anne boss guthu shemppi ekkitte” gidees. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessa gish istti berkka wogolon gelidi issi poqethaso bidda. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Issti bishin daroti beyidi tora wothan issttappe sinthe adhida. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesusay wogoloyppe wodhiza wode daro derey shiqi utidaysa be7ides. Hemizadey baynda mehe mala gidida gish asas qadhetides. Daro yokkka tamarso oykidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>He wode gadey qami qammi biza gish iza kalizayti izakko shiqidi hizgida “Haysi nu dizasoy baazokko gaddey qamides. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Haysa heran assi dizaso biidi assy bess miza kath shamidi mana mala asa yeda gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Izi istas zaridi “asas mizaz inte immitte” gidees. Isttikka malaletidi “nuni bidi namm7u xetu dinarera kath shamidi hayssa asas immizakko gidandee?” gida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">He wode 200 dinare demanas issi assi 200 galas othans koshes </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Izikka istas “intes ay lage ukethi dizakonne anne bidi xelitte” gin istti bi xelidi “ichachu ukethine namm7u moley des” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hessafe kalidi asa cilila maatta bolla oydan oydan utisana mala azazidees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Assaykka xetu xetunne ichachu tammu ichachu tamm gididi oydan utidees. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Izikka ichachu okethane namm7u molista ba kushen oykidi pudde sallo xelidi anjidinne uketha menthi menthi asas gishana mala bena kalizaytas immidees, namm7u molistakka wurso asas shakerethidees. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Assay wurikka midi kalides. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizayti asssay kali min atidaysa tammane namm7u pitha kumeth oydappe shishida. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kathi mida asappe atummasay xala ichachu shiye.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Abba bollara hamutiidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Herakka izzi asa moyzishe izza kalizayti sinthatidi gede pinth Betesayda getetizso pinana mala azazides. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Heppekka ista agagidi wosanas pude zumma bolla kezides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Gaddey qamin wogoloy abba gidon dishin izi berkka biitta bolla dees. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Abba bolla carkoy keezi metida gish izza kalizayti abba shri shiri wogolo lagiza mishara baxetishin Yesusay beydees. Wontta bolla istakko yidees, Yidene ista achara adhi banadan hanidees. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Gido atin adhi bana hanishin iza byda mala moytil7e be7ida milatin wurikka wassida. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Wurikka iza beydi dagamida, izkka herakka issta yochidinne aykoy ba; tanakko dagamofitte gides. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Izikka wogolon isstakko gelin carkkoy co7u gidees, isstikka daro malaletida. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kase izi ukethan othida malata birshech isti eronta gish ista wozinay docides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Abba pinidi Gensarexe getetizaso gakidi wogolappe wodhidi wogoloza hen qachidi aggi bida. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Issti wogoloppe wodhida mala asay Yesusa erides. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Wurikka ba dizaso dizaso woxeretidi harganchata zaphan tooki tooki ekidi Yesusay dizaso ehida. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Izi gakida gutan woykko katamma gidon woykko dere garsan gidin harganchati izi adhishin izza wosidine iza mayo bochidi paxanamala shishi shishi dubbushay dizson wotnida. Izi adhishin iza mayo bochidayti wuri paxida.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kasse aawata wogga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Parsawetinne Yerusalameppe yida issi issi Xafeteti Yesusa gaxa yuyi adhidi <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizaytappe bagayti mecetonta qita kushera kath mishin be7ida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Parsawetinne kasse cimma Aydude asati kasse dere woga naganas kushe lo7othi mecetonta kath mi eretena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Giya bi simikkokka bolla meceti geyonta dishe kath mi eretena. Hesathokka wancakka, ottokka, sanekka, zin7iza hithekka mecha malata hara wogatakka naagetes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Parsawetinne Xafeti Yesusa “nena kalizayti kasse awata wogamala duss agidi aazas kushe mecetonta kath mizo?” gidi oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Izikka istas “Isayasay qodheppe qomo bagan haniza inte gish &lt;haysi derey ba metershan tana bonches woznay gidikko tappe hakidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tas mela hada goynytes; issta timirteykka assi wothida woga xala&gt; gidi yotida tuma.” gidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Xoossa woga agidi assi wothida woga nagetees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassekka “inte wogas giidi Xoossa woga inte agagiza cincatetha ooggey intes dees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ays gikko Musey ne ayone ne aawa boncha; ba ayone ba aawa cayizadey mulekka hayqo gides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin inte qasse issi uray ba aawa woykko ba ayyo inte tappe demmanas koshiza mado ta Xoossas immadis gikko <verse number="12" style="v"/>inte qasse hayssaddey ba aawaskka ba ayyeys hara aykokka othana mala koyekista. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gish inte woga nagana gidi Xoossa qaala lamista. Hesantakka milatiza darota othista.” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qassekka Yesusay asa beekko xeygidi “wurikka ta giza siyitene wozinan wothitte. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kareppe ulo gido gelidi ass tunisiza issi miishika deena. Harappekka asse tunisizay kethawappe gede kare keziza misha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Siyiza haythi dizay siyo” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Izi asa karen agidi keth gelin iza kalizayti izi yotida lemusoza birshech Yesusa oychida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Izikka ista intesikka yoy gellene? Kareppe gelidi asse tunisiza mishi azikka deena. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kareppe gelizay gede wozinan gidonta; dugge qantha gido geles qasse heppe izade asatethappe gede kare kezes.” Yesusay hessa giday assi miza kathi wurikka gesh gididaysa qoncisanasa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kalethidikka “asappe kezizazi asse tunises. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Assa wozina gidoppe kezizay iita qofata laymma ammone, kaysotethi, asse wodho laymeteth, <verse number="22" style="v"/>yiqeteth, itateth, baletho, laymma kasse, qanateteth, asa sunth moro, otorotethinne, azala. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hayti iitta hanoti wuri asappe kezetesinne asse tunisetes” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Issi macashay ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Heeppe kezidi Xirosa giza dere bidees, hen issade keth gelidi izi hen dizaysa assi erontamala koydees. Gido atin izi hen iza dusay qotistanas danda7etibeyna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Herakka issi tuna ayanay oykida qi na dizari aya Yesusay hen diza siyada izakko yada iza too bolla kundadus. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Macashaya Ayhude gidonta Girike qaala hasa7iza macashi shin izi yeleta gadey Sirofinqe getetes. Izakka yesusay izi nayeppe tuna ayna kesana mala wosadus. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izikka zaridi izis “nayta qumma ekki kanas yeganas besonta gish koyro nayti mi kaleto” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Izakka zarada “E Godo kanatikka madda matan de7idi nayta kusheppe gaden wodhidaysa meteskko” gadus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Izikka “histiko neni hessa gida gish ba daydanthay ne nayeppe kezidees” gidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Iza simadda so bishin naya daydanthay yedin paxada hixan zin7idaro demadus.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay issi duna mumene haytha tule ass pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hesafe Yesusay Xirosa bitappe dendidi Sidona gizasora adhidi Tammu katama gizasora kanthidi gede Galila abbakko gakidees. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Assay issi haytha tulene ayfe qoqe assi izakko he ekiyidi Yesusay iza bolla ba kushe wothanan mala wosida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesusaykka iza asappe shakki ekki bidi ba kushe biradhista adeza haythan gelithidees, qassekka cuchu cutidi addeza inxarsa bochidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pudde salo xelidine tokki shempidi “Efata” gides. Hesikka “Pogetta” gussa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Herakka addeza haythati pogetida, inxarsaykka birshetin geshi hasa7idees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesusay hayssa be7idayti onaskka yotonta mala azaziddes, gido attin asay izi azazizdaysafe bollara kehi gujidi yotida. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Derezikka woggappe athi malaletidi “Izi othidaysi wuri lo7o; tuleti siyanamala, mumeti hasa7anamala othides” gida.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay oydu shiye ass muzudes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode qasse daro assi shiqides, shiqida asas miza kathi baynda gish Yesusay bena kalizayta xeygidi hizgidees; <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hayti asati tanara heedzdzu galas gakanas gam7ida gishinne qassekka istas miza kathi baynda gish tana miichetes. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Istappe issi issi asati hahoppe yida gish hayssa gafara ta ista so yedikko daburidi ogge bolla kundana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iza kalizaytikka zaridi “hayssa bazon hayssa mala dere muzana qumma awappe demmane?” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Izikka ista intekkon appun ukethi dize? gi oychidees. Isttkka “lappun ukethi dees” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Izikka asay gadde bolla utana mala azazides; lappun uketha ba kushen oykidi galtidinne menthidi asas gishechanamala bena kalizaytas immin istika derezas gishida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Qassekka hen diza qeri molista gish Xoossu galatidi asas gishistanamala bena kalizayta azazidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Dereukk midi kalidees. Hessappekka iza kalizayti madappe tirfida kath lappun pitha kummeth denthida. <verse number="9-10" style="v"/>Hessa mida asay oydu shiye gidana. He asa moyzidi bena kalizatara wogolon gelidi gede Dalmanuta getetizaso bidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Parsaweti yidi Yesusara palameteth oykida. Iza paacanas koydi bena saloppe malata besana mala oychida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Izikka tooki shmepidi “Haysi yeletazi aazas malata koyizee? Ta intes tummu gays hayssa yelets issi malataykka immetena gidees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ista hen agidinne wogolon gelidi he pinth piniddees.</para>
  <para style="s">Parsawista irshonne Herodosa irsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Izza kalizayti kath oykonta baletida gish issi uketh atin wogolo gidon hara ay kathikka deena. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesusay ista “Parsawista isrshppenne Herodosa irshoppe nagetitte gidi azazidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Issti qasse ba garsan issay issara “izi nuna hayssa gizay nuss kath baynda gishasakko” gi yotetida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Qasse Yesusay issta qofa eridi &lt;Nuss kathi baynda gish gasa&gt; gidi inte garsan aazas hasa7eteti? Ha7ikka yushi qopeketi? Wozinanka wotheketi? woykko inte wozinay mumidee? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Intees ayfey dees shin xeleketi? Haythi dees shin siyeketi? Akekeketi? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ichachu uketha ichachu shiye asas ta mentha immin appun pitha kumeth kath denthideti?” gides. Isstika zaridi “tamanne namm7u” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Izikka “Lappun uketha oydu shiye asas ta mentha immin appun pitha kumetha kathi denthideti” gi oychin isstika “lappun” gida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Izikka istta histin “Ha7i gakanas yushi qopibeykistaka” gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Betesaydan issi qoqe assi pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessfe gede Betesayda gizaso bida. Gutha asatikka issi ayfe qoqe assi Yesusakko ehidi Yesusay iza bochanamala wosida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Izikka he qoqeza kushe oyki gochidi asssi dizasoppe gede kare kesidi addeza ayfen cutidinne ba kushe iza bolla wothidi ha7i ness azi betize? gi oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Izikka dhoqu gi xelidi “asay mith milatidi qaxetishe betes” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Qassekka Yesusay ba kushista iza ayfeta bolla wothidees, herakka iza ayfeti xelida, kasse po7oykka izas simmin wursikka geshi xelidees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qasse “ha gutata gido geloppanne oonasikka yotoppa” gidi iza gede izaso yedidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Xoossappe kitetidade gididaysa Phixirosay markatides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesusay bena kalizaytara Pilipos Qisariya achan diza gutata bidees, Issti oogge bolla dishin benna kalizayta “tana asay oona gize?” gidi oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Issttikka zaridi nena “Xammaqiza Yanisa gizaytikka deetes, bagayti qasse Elasa getees, harati qass Nabistappe issade getees gidi yotida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kalethidikka Intech tana oona geti? gidi oychidees. Pixirosay “Neni Kirstosa (Xoossappe kitetidade) gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ba gish oonasika istti yotontamala minthi yotides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ba hayqanaysa kasetidi yotidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessafe Yesusay bena kalizayta “asa nay daro waye beyanaysane dere cimmatan, qesista halaqanine, xafistan kadhistanaysa asa kushen hayqanaysa, hayqoppe hezantho galas dendanas besizaysa tamarso oykidees. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Izikka hessa istas qoncisi yotidees, Pixirosaykka iza dumma shaki efidi hessaththo goppa gidi hanqidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesusay qass bena kalizayta yushi xelishe Pixirosa “Xal7e ne tappe gede guye ba, neni asazappe atin Xoossaz qopakka” gidi hanqidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hessafe guye asa bena kalizaytara issippe bekko xeygidi “tana kalanas dosizadey dikko bena kado ba masqale tokidi tana kalo” gidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Be shemppo ashana dosizadey dhaysana shin ta gishine ta mishiracho qaala gish ba shemppo dhaysizadey wurikka ashana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Assi alame kumeth harikkone ba shempofe mela atikko iza ay go7anne? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ero assi ba shemppo gish lame ekanay azi dize? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hayssa laymane nagarncha yeleta gidon dishe tananine ta qalan yelatiza assi wuri ta asa nay taa aawa bonchoranne gesha kitanchatara yiza wode issstan yelatana.” gides.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kalethidikka Yesusay “ta intes tummu gays ha eqida asafe Xoossa kawotethi wolqara yishin beyana gakanas hayqonta issi issi asati detess” gidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa malay lametidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Usupun galassafe guye Yesusay Phixirosa Yaqobbene Yanisa benara kalethi ekkidi issi giitta zumma bolla kezidees. Issti berkka dishin issta sinthan iza medhay lammeti wodhides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izi mayda mayoy bitta bolla onikka mayo mecidi hessa mala bothanas danda7onta bothu botides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>He wode Elasaynne Mussey Yesusara hasa7etishe istas betida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Phixirosay Yesusa “Asatemare nuni han hayssan dizakko nus lo7oko; nes issi dasse, Musses issi dasse, qasse Elassas issi dasse, hezu daassista nu othikoch? gidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Daro babida gish Phixirosay ba gizaysa eridi gibeyna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Heerakka sharay ista kamin shara gidora “Haysi ta dosiza ta naza izi giza siyitte” giza qaala girethi yides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Herakka issti yushi xelin Yesusappe atin oonikka hara uray istara dena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Issti zumma bollappe duge wodhishin asa nay hayqofe dendana gakanas hayssa isti be7idaysa oonaskka yotonta mala azazidees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Istika bes yotida qaala ba wozinan oykida shin “Hayqoppe dendo gussi ay gusakkonne” gidi ba garasan hasa7etida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Qasse issti Musse woga tamarsizayti kasetidi Elasay yana koshes aazas gizo? gidi iza oychida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesusay istas “Tumukka Elasay kassetidi yidi wursikka kasse mala oothana. Histinikka asa nay daro waye eekanasinne kadhistanas beses geteti xafetidaysi intes ay milatize? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gido atin ta intess gizay Eelasay gidikko yidess shin asaykka iza gish xafetida mala bena koshida mala iza bolla othides.” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay iita ayanay oykidda issi naa pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Dugge garsan atida Yesusa kalizaytakko issti simi yishin daro asay issta gidothin Musse woga tamarsizayti istara palametizaysa beyida. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Derey iza demida mala malaletidi sarotana izakko woxidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Izikka ista “Inte istara aza gish palameteti?” gidi oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Assa garsafe issadey “Astemare tuna ayanay izan gelin duna mumida ta na daysa ta neekko eekka yadis, <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ayanazi dendiza wode bollafe yegess; dunara goponto kessi kessi yegesss; achekka garcess; asatethakka zodisses. Tunna ayana keseto gada nena kalizayta ta oychin istikka danda7ibeytena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istatas zaridi “Inteno amanonta yeletato, ayde gakanas ta intenara danne? Qasse ayde gakanas ta intena danda7ane? Aane naza ha ehitte” gidees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Assaykka naza izakko ehidees, tunna ayanay Yesusa be7ida mala naza herakka biitta bolla gendersidi kokorsidinne dunnara goponto coopu histides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesusay naza aawa “Haysi hargey izza oykin woqqa wodde? gidees. Naza aawaykka “natethafe domidi” gides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iza wodhanas koydi daro wode tamankka hathankka yegess, ness danda7etikko nuss michistanne nunna madda gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusay qasse “Ness danda7etikko gay? Aamanizadees wurikka danda7etess” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Naza aaway herakka “Ta ammanays shin ta amanoy lafa, tanna madarikki” giidi wassidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Assay wocamishe bureti eekidi izakko yizaysa Yesusay beydi “Hayso tulene mume ayanazo hayssa nazappe keza, ne qasse simada gelonta mala ta nena azazays” gidi tuna ayana seridees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tunna ayanazika kehi wasidees, nazikka kehi qaketidappe guye nazappe kezidees. Daroti hayqidees gana gakanas nazi an7ah milatidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesusay naza kushe oyki denthidees. Nazikka dendi eeqidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesusay so gelidappe guye iza kalizayti “Nu izappe tunna ayana kessanas aazas danda7ibeykoni?” giidi iza oychida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Izikka istas “hayssa malay kezana danda7izay wosaninne xoomman xallala” gidees</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ba hayqo gishinne ba dendo gish qassekka yotidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Heppe dendi Galila bagara adhi bida. Yesusay ba dizso oonikka eeranamala koybeyna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gassoykka Yesusay bena kalizaytas “Assa nay asa kushen adhi immistana istikka iza wodhana, hezantho galasafe guye izi dendana” giidi issta tamarsiza gishasa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Gido atin izi gizaysi isstas gelibeyna; iza ooychanasikka babida.</para>
  <para style="s">Wursoppe adhdhizay oone?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Qifirnahomme bidda. Izi keth gelidi “Inte ooge bolla aza gish palametideti” gi oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Isstti qass ooge bolla “Nu garssan nuppe wursoppe adhizay oone?” gidi palametida gish wurikka co7u gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Izi utidappe guye tammane namm7ata xeygidi “Koyro gidana koyizadey wursoppe wursethinne wursotas ashkara gido” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Qii gutha na ehidi ista gidon esidinne idimmidi <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hayta gutha anaytappe issade ta sunthan mokki ekkizadey tannakka mokki ekes. Tana mokki ekizadey wuri tana xalala gidonta tana kitidaysakka mokki ekkes” gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Nuna ixxontay wuri nu bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yanisaykka “Astemare, issadey ne sunthan daydanth kesishin nu beydos. Izi nuna kalonta gish kesonta mala digidos” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesusay qasse “digopitte oonikka ta sunthan malata oothidi esotidi ta bolla iitta hasa7anas danda7ena” gidees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nunara eeqetontay wuri nunara dees. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ta intes tumu gays inte tiyetida Kirstosas gidida gish ta sunthan issi qulle hath intena ushidadey wuri ba oothoysi waga dhayena.</para>
  <para style="s">Assas dhuphe gidanappe nageteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hayta tana amaniza ha guthatappe issade dhuphizay wuri dexo woxa shuchi iza qodhen qashetin duge abba gido ooletidakko izas keya gidana. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hessa gish ne kushey nena balethikko neppe qanxa yegga namm7u kushera gede ganamme tamman ne banaysafe kushe duxa gidada gede de7on geloy ness lo7o gidana. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ganamen guxuneyne hayqena, tamaynne to7ena. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nena ne toy balethikko neppe qanxa diga namm7u tora gede ganame taman yegistanappe ne wobbe gidada gede deyoso geloy ness lo7o. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ganamen guxuneyne hayqena, tamaynne to7ena. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nena ne ayfey balethikko woca kessada neppe diga, namm7u ayfera gede ganamen yegistanappe issi ayfera gede Xoossa kawoteth geloy ness lo7o. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ganamen guxuneyne hayqena tamaynne to7ena. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Burro assi wuri tamman pacistana (metora adhana woykko xillo tamay geshana)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Maxinney lo7o, gido attin maxinney ba maxineteth yedikko inte wosti iza mal7o eranne? Inte asatethan maxinney do inte inte garsan dosetitte.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Macho anjanas besena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesusay heppe dendidi gede Yuda giza derene Yordanose shaafappe pinthan diza dere bidees. Dereykka qasse iza yuyi adhin izi kasse ba oothiza mala asa tamarsides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Issi issi Parsaweti izakko yiidi “Assi ba machcho anjanas besize?” gidi iza pace oycho ooychida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izikka istas “Mussey intena ay gi azazide?” gidi zari oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Isstikka izas “Mussey ta izo anjadis giza waraqata xafi immidi anjo gidees” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi istta “Mussey hayssa mala woga xafidaysi inte wozinay minida gishasa” gidees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido attin Koyro Xoossi medhishe macanne adde oothi medhidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gish assi ba aawane ba ayo agidi ba machchira waxetess. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Namm7ay issi asho gidetes, hessa gish istti namm7ay issinoppe atin namm7u detena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hesa gish Xoossi gathi waxidayta assi shakofo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qassekka issti so gelin iza kalizayti he yoza gish zari iza oychida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izi istas “Oonikka ba machcho anjidi hara macash ekiko he macashay bolla laymma oothes. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Macashayakka ba azina agada hara ade gelikko izakka laymataysu” gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay gutha nayta anjidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesusay bocherechana mala asay nayta izakko ehidees. Iza kalizayti qassse ehida asa bolla hanqettida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesusay hessa bey hanqetidi “Nayti taakko yeto digofitte, Xoossa kawotethi haytanta malasa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta intes tumu gays Xoossa kawoteth hayssa gutha nayta mala ekontadey izin mulekka gelena.” gides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nayta idimidi ista bollla ba kushe wothidi anjides.</para>
  <para style="s">Issi dure adde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Heeppe buro oge kezishin issi uray wooxishe izakko gakidinne iza sinthan gulbatidi “Lo7o astemare tani medhina deyo demana mala ay oothana tass besize?” gi ooychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “Azas tana Lo7o gay? Issi Xoossafe atin kiyay ba” gides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Neni azazota eray? Wodhoppa laymatoppa kaysotoppa wordo markatofa asse balethoppa ne aawane ne ayo boncha gizayta” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Adezikka zaridi “Astamare ta hayta wurssa natethafe ooykkada nagadis” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesusay iza xelidinne dosidi “Histikko ha7i ness issi miish paces badanne ness diza ubbaa bayza, miisha manqotas imma, neni salon shiqida miish demandasa, histadane haaya tana kala” gidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Adezikka hessa siyidi daro muzotidees. Izas daro haroy diza gish muzotishe bidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesusay yushi athi xelidi bena kalizayta “duristas Xoossa kawoteth geloy ay mala dexo!” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iza kalizaytikka iza hasa7an malaletida. Yesusay qasse zaridi “nayto, Xoossa kawoteth geloy ay mala dexo miishe! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Durey Xoossa kawoteth gelanaysafe gamelay narfe lukkora adhanaysi kawuyana!” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iza kalizaytikka darsi malaletidi ba garsan issay issa “Histin ooni attana danda7ize?” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesusay ista xelidine “Haysi asas danda7etena, Xoossa matan gidikko hessamala gidena. Xoossas wurikka danda7etees” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Phixirossay qasse “Hekko nuni wursikka agidi nena kalidos” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi “Ta intes tumu gays ta gishinne mishiracho qaala gish gidi ba keth woykko ba ishata woykko ba michista woykko ba aayo woykko ba aawwa ba nayta woykko ba gade agida uray wuri <verse number="30" style="v"/>hayssa ha wodezan ha7i goodetethara kethata, ishata, michista, aayeta, naytanne gadekka xeetu kushe athi ekontaynne burro yana alamezanikka medhina deyo latontadey deena. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gido atin daro sinthatidayti guyista, guyetidayti sinthata.” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay ba hayqi dendanaysa hedzantho yotidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Issti Yerusalame efiza ooge bolla dishin Yesusay istafe sinthe sinthe bess. Iza kalizayti iza bussan malaletida. Hankko iza gedon diza asay qass izas babidees. Qassekka tammane namm7ata derezappe dumma shakidi ba bolla azi gakanakonne istas hiz gi yotidees; <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Nuni Yerusalame kezana, asa nay qesista halaqatassine Muse woga tamarsizaytas adhi immistana, istikka iza bolla hayqo pirda pirdanane dere asas athi immana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Iza bolla qidhi ka7ana, iza bolla cutana, izakka garafanane wodhana shin izi hezu galasafe guyen hayqoppe dendana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yaqobeynne Yanisay wossidda wossa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Qasse Zabbidossa nayti Yaqobeyne Yanisay izakko shiqidi “Astamare nuni nena wosidaza ne nus ubbaa oothanamala nu koyos” gida. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Izikka istas “ta intees ay oothana mala koyeti?” gidees. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Istika “Neni ne boncho son nuppe issadey ne oshachan issadey ne hadirsan utnamala nus ero garki” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “Inte oychizaysa erekista, tanni uyana usha uyanasine tani xamaqetiza xinqata xamaqistanas danda7andeti?” gidees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Isttika zaridi “Ee danda7os” gida. Yesusaykka “ta uyza usha inte uyanane ta xamaqetiza xinqata inte xamaqistana. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin ta oshachara woykko ta hadirsara utethi istas gigidaytasa attin ta iimmana miish gidena” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Tammanti hessa siyidi Yaqobene Yanisa bolla hanqettida. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesusaykka issi bolla shishidi “Dere halaqa getetizayti dere harizaysa mala istta shuumeti ista bolla ba godateth besizaysa inte ereta. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Gido atin inte garsan gitta gidana koyzadey wuri ashikara gido. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Sinthe adhana koyzay wuri wursos ayle gido. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Asa nay gidikko asas oothansine ba shemppo darota gish athi immans yades atin ase othisanas yibeyna.” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay qoqe Berxemossa ayfe pathidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Heppe gede Yarkko bida. Yesusaynne iza kalizayti hara daro asatara Yarkofe kezishin Xemosa naa Berxemossa getetiza ayfe qoqey ooge bolla utidi woses. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Izikka yizay Nazirete Yesusa gididaysa siyidi “Dawite na Yesusa tana mara” gidi kehi wasidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Daroti izi co7u gana mala hanqida, gido attin izi “Dawiteno tana mara” gidi kehi wassidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesusaykka eqidi “iza ha xeygitte” gidees. Istika qoqeza “Aykoy ba denda nena xeyges” gida. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Izikka ba mayo qari yegidi puthuku gi dendi eqidi Yesusakko yides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “Ta ness ay oothanamala koyaz” gidees. Qoqezikka “Aastamare ta xelanas koyays” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi “Ba nena ne aamanoy pathidees” gidees. Herakka iza ayfey xelidees. Izikka yesusa kali bides.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay gita bonchora Yurusalame gelidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Isti gede Yerusalame Dabirazayte giza zumma achan diza Betefagenne Bitaniya gizaso matida wode Yesuay bena kalizaytappe namm7ata hizgi kitidi; <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Gede inte sinthan diza gutayo bitte, inte he gelida mala hen assi iza togi eronta qashon diza harre gutte inte demmana; birshidi iza ha ekiyitte. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onikka intena hayssa ays ootheti? gikko Godas koshesn gidi yotite, izikka intes eeson zari yedana” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Isstikka bidi issi ketha karen oge bolla qachetti diza hare gutte demidi birshida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hen eqida issi issi asati “Hare guteza aazas birsheti” gi oychida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesusa kalizayti Yesusay istas gidamala asatas yotin eero eki biite gida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gutezakka Yesusakko ehidi ba mayo iza zokko bolla yegin Yesusay iza togidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Daro asay ba mayo kessi kessi ogge bolla micidees. Baga asay cilila mihta hathi qanxi qanxidi ogge bolla lalidees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesusappe sintharanne guyera diza asay qaala dhoqu hisitidi “Hossana Goda sinthan yizadey anjetidade. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hanna yizara nu aawa Dawite kawotehaya anjetidaro, hosana bolla salon Xoossi boncheto” gishe wassidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesusay Yerusalame gakidi hessapekka maqidasse gelidees. He heran dizaysa wursi xelidi gadey qamida gish tamane namm7atara gede Bittanya kezides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay qangida balase miththayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wontetha galas issti Bittanyappe kezi bishin Yesusay gafides. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Izi issi haythi cililida balase getetiza mith hahon beydi ayfey danakonne gidi izikko yidees. Giddo atin balase mith ayfonta wode gidida gish boncofe atin issi ayfeykka izippe demibeynna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa gish mithiyo “Hanife guye medhinas onikka neppe ayfe moppo” gidees. Iza kalizaytikka izzi gizaysa siyida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gede Yerusalame bida heppeka gede maqidase gelidi hen bayzizaytanne shamizayta kessi godo oykidees. Mishe lamizayta xaraphezane wolle bayzizayta oyddee gufanthi gufanthi yegidees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Onnikka ay miish tokidi maqidees gibe gidora adhonta mala digidees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Istakka tamarsishe “Ta kethi dere wursos Woossa keth gidana geteti xafetibeyne? Gido atin inte qasse kaysonta gongolo kesidista” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Qessista halaqatinne Muse woga tamarsizayti hessa siyidi iza wosti dhaysanakkone oogge koshu oykida. Giko atin dereykka iza timirttezan malaletida gish izas babida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Istika gadey qamin katamayppe kezi bida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wontetha galas malado isti oggera adhi bishin balasse miththaya xaphoppe melidaro be7ida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yozi iza wozanan akeketin Phixirosay Yesusa “Astammare hekko hanna ne qangida balaseya meladus” gidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Izikka zarid “Xossu ammanitte. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays &lt;Oonikka hayssa zummaza ne dhoqalistada gede abban gela&gt; gizakkone hessakka wozanan sidhonta ammanidakko izadees hanana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gish inte wossan oychidaz wursi eekida mala ammanikko intes hanana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessathokka inte wosas eqiza wode inte sallo aaway inte nagara atto gana mala intekka intena qohidayta nagarawursi atto gitte. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Inte atto gonta ixikko inte sallo aawaykka inte nagara atto gena.” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Qassekka Yerusalamme yida. Yesusay maqidasse kare gidon gedene hanne yuyetishin qessista halaqati Muse woga tamarsizaytinne dere cimmati izakko shiqidi <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Haysa ne oothizay ay godatethara? Hayta ne oothana mala hayssamala godateth ness ooni immide?” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas zaridi “Aanne takka intena issi oycho ooychaysi intekka tass zarikko takka ha yotta ay godatethara oothizakkonne intes yotana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yanisa xinqatey Xoossafe ye asappe? anne tass zaritte” gidees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Isstikka ba garsan issay issara “Nu saloppe gikko izi nuna histin aazas iza ammanibeyketi? gana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nu asappekko gikko Yanisay tummu nabbe gididaysa derey wuri ammaniza gish hessaththo gana babida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gish nu eerokko gidi Yesusas zarida. Yesusaykka “Histikko ta hayta aza godatethara oothizakkonne takka intes yotikke” gidees.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Woyne mith tokkiza gosha asata lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qasse istas lemusora yotishe hizgidees “Isadey ba woyne mith tokides. Birda yushi athides; woyne miththa ayfe gum7ana olla bokidees nago kethekka kexides. Hesafe goshanchatas kira imidi hara dere bides. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mithay ayfizawode woyne miththa ayfe eeka ya gidi ashikaratappe isade goshanchatakko yedidees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Goshanchati ashikaraza oykidi wadhidi mela kushe yedida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Namm7anthokka hara ashikara yedidees. Goshanchatti ha7ikka ashikara oykki hu7istara bo7idinne kawushidi zari yedida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ha7ikka zaridi hara ahshikara yedidees. He yedoysakka wodhida; hara darota gidofe issi issi asata qoxida; bagayta wodhida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha7ikkka kitanas haray dees; izikka aaway dosiza iza naaza. Ta naza isti bossana gi qopidi wursethan ba naza yeddides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Goshancahti qass ba garsan “Haysi wana iza latana nazakko ha yitte nu iza wodhikko bittay nuss gidana” gidda. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gish hen oyki wodhidi woynne miththaya dizasoppe haraso kessi yegida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Histin woynne miththa goday intes ay oothana milatize? Izi yana, goshanchatakka wodhana, woynne miththa haratas immana. <verse number="10-11" style="v"/>Maxxafan “Shucha keth kexizayti hanena giidi wora yegida shuchay ketha ma7izenes bolla hu7e gididees hessakka Goday othidees. Hessikka nu ayfes malalizaz” getetidi xafetidaysa nababibeyketi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maizane shuchay tussi keth nagizaysa mala shucha kethi wodonta mala nagizaza.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Izi istas lemusoza yotiday ista gish gididaysa Ayhude halaqati erida gish iza oykanas koyda. Gido atin asas babida gish yegidi bida.</para>
  <para style="s">Giira gish shiqida oycho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iza yon qaxxana mala Parsawistappene Herodosa bagatappe qorerethidi issi issi ass izakko yedida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Istika izakko yidi “Astemare neni moroy baynda ass gididaysa nu eros; ne oonaskka babada wordo madakka; Xoossa oogge xalala tummu tamarsasa. Oromme kawo qesares gira qanxanas besizeye besene? Nu qanxinoye qanxofino? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesusaykka ista oychoy qodheppe qommo gididaysa eridi &lt;Azas tana qaxana koyeti?&gt; Anne issi dinare hamite ta beyays gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Isstikka misha ehin “Haysi iza bolla dizay oona misilenne misille bolla xafetidaysi oona gize? gidees. Istika qesareysakko gida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinarey nu dere sante mala gidi kaqo qesare misiley iza sunthi iza bolla xafetides.</char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “Qessareysa qessares, Xoossisa Xoossas immitte” gidees. Isstikka iza zaron malaletida.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqoppe dentha gish shiqida oycho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessappe guye hayqidaytas hayqoppe denthi bawa giza saduqaweti izakko yidi iza hizgi oychida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Astamare issades machcho ekidi na yelonta hayqikko hayqidaysa ishay iza machcheyo ekkidi izas lata na yelana mala kasse Mussey nus xafidees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gido attin lapun ishanti detees; istafe bayray machcho ekkidi na yelonta hayqidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kalozi he macashayo ekidi ha7ikka na yelonta hayqidees. Hezanthoykka yelonta hayqidees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lappunatikka he macashayo ekkidi latta yelibeyttena wursethan macashayakka hayqadus. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Histin lappunatikka izo ekkidashin hayqoppe dendoy diza gidikko ha macashaya istafe onna machcho gidane?” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas hiz gidees “Inte baletizay gesha maxafatane Xoossa wolqa erontagishaskko. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hayqidayti dendiza wode salo kiitanchata mala gidana atin ekketenane geletena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hayqidayta dentha gishas gidikko Musse maxafan hesikka qeeri wora gidon eexiza tama gidofe Xoossi “Tanni Aabiramme Xoossa; Yisaqe Xoossa; Yaqoobe Xoossa gididaysa nababibeyketi? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Xoossi paxata Xoossu atin hayqethata Xoossu gidena. Hessa gish inte daro baletidetta.” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Isstii palamman dishi n Xafistappe issadey ista palamma siyidinne Yesusay oychetidaysas lo7othi zaridaysa akkekidi “Eero azazotappe wursooppe adhizay awayse?” gidi oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yeususay izas hiz gidees “Wursooppe adhizay hayssa &lt;Isra7ele siya Gosa Xoossi issi Goda, <verse number="30" style="v"/>nekka Goda ne Xoossa ne kumetha wozinappe, ne kumetha shempofe, ne kumetha qofappe, ne kumetha woqappe dossa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Namm7anthoykka ne lagge ne hu7e mala dossa.” ha namm7atappe adhiza azazoy bawa.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Xaafezikka “Aastamare lo7o gadasa Xoossi issino gididaysanne izappe haray bayndaysa ne yotidaysi like. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iza ne kummetha wozinnappe ne kummetha qofappe ne kumetha wolqappe dossoy Qassekka ne lagge ne hu7e mala dossoy Xugetiza yarshopene hara yarsho wursoppe adhes” gidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesusayka adezi yushi qoppidi zaridaysa beydi “Neni Xoossa kawotethappe hahondakka.” gidees. Hessappe guye iza ooychanas xalida uray betibeynna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuaya maqidase gathan tamarsishe Muse woga tamarsizayti aazas Kirstosay Dawite na gizo? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Dawitey Xiillo Aayanan hasa7ishe “Goday ta Goda ne morketa ta ne too gars athana gakanas ta ushchan uta gidees” gess. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Histin Dawitey ba dunara iza Goda gikko wanidi simmi izas na gidane? gidees. Daro dereykka izgizaysa ufaysara siyidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Izi tamarsishe hiz gidees “Muse woga tamarsizaytappe nagetite, gaderea gochetiza adussa mayo mayidi yush yuyana dosetees; awankka adhi adhi ass istas boncho sarotta immana mala koyettees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ayhudata wossa kethan dhoqaso, digisasonkka/gibirasonkka/ bonchoso koyetes. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Isti azinay baynda macasha keeth kalosetees, qasskka bena besanas adusa wossa wossetes. Haytanti iitta pirda pirdistana.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammey Muxuwata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesusaykka asay muxuwata yegizason utidi daro asati immizayssa maqidasse misha shishiza saxinen yegizaysa xelidees. Daro dureti daro miish yegida. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Issi azinay baynda amm7o dizara issi sikkinappe daronta xarqumala biratappe othetida namm7u miish yegadus. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesusay bena kalizayta xeygidi ta intes tumu gays “Saxinezan yegida wursoppe hana manqo am7eya adheth yegadus. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hayti wuri ba diza tirppa mishappe yegidashin hana qasse ba manqotetha wolqara bess dizaysa sinthafe izo koshizaysara ubbaa immadus” gides.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Maqidasey lalistanaysa Yesusay kasetidi yotidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Izi maqidaseppe kezishin iza kalizaytappe issay astemare haysi kethaynne kethay kexetida shuchay ay mala lo7izakkone hayssa beyay? gidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yeusayakka zaridi “hayta giitta kethata xelay? shucahti issay issa bolla diza mala detena, wurikka lalistana” gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Wode wursetha malatata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yeususay maqidaseza ginara Dabirazayte zumma bolla utidishin Phixirosay, Yaqobey, Yanisaynne Indirasay xalla izakko shiqidi <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Haysi ayde hananakkone nus yot. Haysi wursethan polistanas malatay aze? gi oychida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas hizgidees “Oonikka intena balethonta mala nagetite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Buro daroti &lt;Ta Kirstosa&gt; gishe ta sunthan yana, darotakka balethana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Inte olanne olla wore siyiza wode dagamopitte. Hessi hananaysi attena. wursethi gidikko burona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Derey dere bolla kawoy kawo bolla dendana, daroson bitta qathinne qoshay hanana, heyti wuri mixas leeso malla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte intes nagetite. Buro intena dere dulatan athi immana. Isti intena Ayhudata wossa kethan garafana. Inte ta markata gidana mala ta gish dere dananata sinthaninne kawota sinthan eeqana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kyoyrotidi mishiracho qalay dere wursos sabakistana beses. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Inte oyketidi pirdas shiqiza wode hino he sateyin intes immetizaro hasa7ite atin bidi nu ay gino gidi kaseti hirgopitte. Hasa7anay Xiillo Ayanappe atin intena gideketta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ishay isha aaway ba na hayqos athi immana. Nayti bena yelidayta bolla makal7ananne wodhana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta gedon inte asa wurson ixetidayta gidana. Wurseth gakanas mini eeqidadey gidikko atana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yerusalame bolla gakkana gita meto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte, dhaysana tunatethi izas besontason eeqidashe beykko nababizadey wozinan wotho, Yudan dizayti pude zumma bolla gangeto. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ketha karen dizadey so gelofo ba miish kesana gidi kethe geloppo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Goshason dizadey ba mayo ekanas guye simoppo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>He galasatan qanthera diza macashatasine na dhanthizaytas aye ana! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessikka balgon gidonta mala Xoossu wositte. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Koyro Xoossi medhetetha wursi medhosoppe ha7i gakanas woykko hayssappe guye izara lemusotizay baynda gitta metoy hanana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Goday he galasata qanthotakkao oonikka atena shin bess doretidayta gish he galasata qanthides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode oonikka hekko kirstosay hayssan dees, gikko woykko hekko hen dees gikko amanopitte. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wordo kirstosatinne wordo nabeti buro dendidi malatatane kasse hani eeronta palamish oothon istas danda7etikko haray ato shin doretidaytakka balethana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessa gish nagetite, he wodey gakonta dishin haara hayssa ubbaa ta intes yotadis.</para>
  <para style="s">Kirstosa namm7antho yuss</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>He wode he metozappe kalidi awa arshey dhummana aginaykka po7uku. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Xoolinteti saloppe qoqofistana, salon diza wolaqamati qaaxana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wode asa nay gitta wolqarane bonchora salo sharara yishin asay iza beyana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izikka kiitanchata yedidi oydu bagafe/mizaneppe/ biitta gaxappe salo gaxa gakanas diza bess doretidayta shishana.</para>
  <para style="s">Balase miththay lemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lumusoza balase miththafe tamaritte. Unquloy cililiza wode haythe kesishin bonney matidaysa inte ereista. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hesathokka hayti ta gidayti poletishin inte beykko wodey mati yidi penge gakidayssa erite. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ta intes tumu gays ha yoti polistana gakanas haysi ha yeletay adhena. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Saloynne haysi biittay adhana shin ta qalay gidikko adhena.</para>
  <para style="s">Goda yana galasiyonne sateyo oonikka erena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Qasse he glasay gish woykko he satey gish ta aawappe atin salo kitanchata gidinkka naza gidnkka onikka erena. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gish wodey aydekkone inte eronta gish nagetite, minitene wositte. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Haysikka ba keth ashikaratas agidi; ashskarata issa issa iza iza ootho oythidi penge nagizaysi begidi nagana mala azazidi bida asa milates. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Histikko ketha aaway wode yanakone woykko qama gidi gidoth yanakone woykko kutoy wasishin yanakone woykko wonta bolla sosey zo7ishin yanakko inte erontagish begidi nagitte. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Izi yishin inte qopponta zin7idashe izi intena demofo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ta intes yotizaysa asa wursos yotays, minidi nagite&gt; gays.”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Assay Yesusa wodhanas maqetides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pazigane uketh muussa ba7ale galasay bonchetanas namm7u galasi atishin qesista halaqatine Muse woga tamarsizayti Yesusa balethi oykidi wodhdana ogge koyida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gido atin asay meto medhonta mala ha bocho ba7ale galasatan gidoppo gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izi Biittaniya giza son issi kasse inchiracha hargi paxida Simona getetizaysa son quumma bolla dishin waagay daro al7o gidida nadorse getetiza shitoy kummi utida philqaxe ooykida issi macashaya philqaxeza menthada shitoza Yesusa hu7e bolla gusadus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hen gadan diza asatappe issi issi asati “haysi shitozi aazas wogay baynda gukize?” gidi ba garsan hanqettida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shitozi bayzo bayzidakko heedzdzu xeetu dinareppe bollara bayzetidi manqotas immistanashin, giidi macashiyokka kadhida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">300 dinarey gussi issi beni wode issi uras laytha damoza. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesusay istas hizgidees “agitte hano macashayo aazas wayseti? Iza tass lo7o miish oothadus. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Manqoti ay wodekka intenara detees. Inte koyda wode aydekka ista madanas danda7ista shin ta gidikko wursso wode intenara dikke. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hanna ba oothanas danda7izari keena oothadus. Tass mogos gidana mala ta asho kasista tiyadus. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays haysi mishiracho qalay alame kumethan sabaketizason awankka iza othidaysi izo hassa7isizaz gididi hasa7istana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yuday Yesusa athi immanas gigidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessappe guye tamane namm7atappe issay Asqoroto Yuday Yesusa athi immans qesista halaqatakko bidess. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Istika hessa siyidi ufa7etida, izas mishe immans izara gigida. Hessa gish Yesusa athi immanas giga wode nagishe gamm7idees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paziga dorssi shuketiza uuketha mussa bonchiza koyro galas Yesusa kalizayti Yesusakko shiqidi “Paziga ka7o manaso awan gigisana mala koyaz?” gi oychida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Izikka bena kalizaytappe namm7ata hizgi kitides “Gede katama biitte, inte bishin issi hath otora tokidadaey intenara gagana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Izi bidi gelizaso gakanas iza kalitte. Keethadezas “Astamarey nena, tana kalizaytara paziga ka7o manas tas gidiza immatha shemposoy awayse gidees” giitte. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Izikka bolla poqe bolla diza gigi utida aaho so intena bessana, hen izan gigisitte.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iza kalizaytikka kezidi gede katama bida. Wurikka Yesusay gida mala gidi beetides, pazigakka hen gigisida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Gadey qamishin Yesusay bena kaiza tammane namm7atara gakidees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Issti madan dishin ta intess tummu gays inte gidoppe issay izikka tanara issippe mizaysi tana athi immana” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Istika muzotidi “Tanesha? tanesha? gidi issay issay Yesusa” ooychida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Izikka istas “Tamane namm7atappe issay tanara ba kushe keren yedizadekko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kasse xafetida mala asa nay iza gish hayqana shin asa na athi immizades aye! He uray kasse yeletonta agidakko izas lo7okoshin!” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Goda ka7o ekko woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Issti mishin uketha eeki anjidinne menthidi bena kalizaytas hayssa ta asho heyte gi imidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ushakka denthi galatidi istas imin isti wurikka uyida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qasse “Haysi darotta gish gukkana ta ooratha caqo suutha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays ooratha woyneppe gigida usha Xoossa kawotethan ta uyana galasiyo gakanas namm7antho hayssa uyikke.” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessafe guye mazmure issippe yexidi pude Dabirazaytte zumma bolla kezida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesusay “Ta hemizaysa shocana he wode iza dorssati laletna geteti xafetidaysa mala inte wurikka tanan duphistana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta dendidaysappe guye gidikko ta inteppe kasistada Galila bana.” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Phixirosaykka “asay wuri dhuphetikkokka tani dhuphetikke!” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesusaykka “Ta ness tumu gays hach qama kutoy namm7u to wasana gakanas neni tana heedzdzu to kadana” gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Phixirosay qass “ta nenara hayqizakkokka mulekka nena kadikke” gidi kehi minthi yotidees. Hankoytikka wuri izaysatho gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Getesemanen wosidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessappe guye Getesemane getetizaso bida Yesusaykka bena kalizayta “Tanni wosishin inte hayssan gamm7isitte” gidees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Phixirosa, Yaqobene Yanisa benara eeki bidees. Kehi muzotideesne hirgidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Qassekka isttas “Ta shempiya daro muzotadus inte han dishittene dhiskonta nagitte” gidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Istta achappe guthu gede paqidi biitta bolla gufanidi hanikko he sateya izappe adhana mala wosidees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Abba aabbo, ness wuri danda7etees, hayssa waye xu7a tappe hasa. Gido attin ne sheneppe atin ta sheney hanoppo” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Izi heppe simi yishin iza kalizayti dhisikidayta beyidees. Phixirsokka “Simona dhiskadi? Haray ato shin issi satekka sura utada nagoy nena xonide? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Inte pacen gelonta mala begidi wositene minite. Shempoy gigeti utidees shin ashoy gidikko daburancha.” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Qassekka bidi koyro wosoysathokka wosides. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Izi namm7antho simi yishin issta ayfen dhiskoy dexxin dhiskidayta demides, shin issti izas ay zaranakonne eribeytena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hezantho yidi “Ha7ikka inte zin7idi shempeti? Ha7i gidana, sateyakka gakkadus hekko asa nay nagaranchata kushen adhi immistana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ane eqitte boss, tana athi immandey yidees.” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay oyketidesinne adhi immetidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Izi buro hasa7an dishin tamane namm7atappe issay Yuday yidees. Izara issippe qesse halaqatapene Muse woga tamarsizaytappe kitetida daro asay githa mashanne durqa oykidi yidees. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Iza athi immana Yuday istas “asa gidoppe ta yerizadey iza gidida gishas oykidi lo7ethi nagi efiite” gidi kaseti malata immi wothides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Gakida malara Yuday Yesusakko shiqidi “Astamare” gidi yeridees. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Assatikka Yesusa oykida. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Iza achan eqida issay masha shohoppe shodidi qessista halaqa ashkara hayth qanxidees. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesusaykka istas “Panga mala tana oykkana mashane durqa oykidi yeti? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wontin wontin maqidassen tamarsashe ta intenara dishin oykibeykista shin kasse xafetidaysi polistan mala haysi hanidees.” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Hessa wode iza kalizayti wuri iza yegi agi bida. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Be kaloteth qeeri naxalan kamida issi nay Yesusa kalishin asssay iza oykin <verse number="52" style="v"/>nazi naxala yegidi kallo kichidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa pirda dulatakko shishida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesusakka gede qessista halaqakko efida. Qessista halaqati dere cimatine Muse woga tamarsizayti hen issippe wuri shiqida. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Phixirosaykka Yesusa hahora kalishe qessista halaqa gibe gakanas bidees. Izi hen utidi hara asatara tamma ho7ishin <verse number="55" style="v"/>qessista halaqatinne dere cimmati wuri Yesusa wodhanas markatana ass koyida shin demanas danda7ibeytena. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Daroti iza bolla wordora markatikkokka markata qalay oyketibeynna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Issi issi markati; <verse number="58" style="v"/>“Haysi adezi &lt;Ta asa kushen kexetida maqidasse lalada asa kushey bochontaz hara maqidasse heedzdzu galasara ta kexana&gt; gishin nu siyidos” gi markatida. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Gidikokka ista markatethi issi bolla woodhibeyna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Qessista halaqaykka ista sinthan dendidi eqqi “Hayti ne bolla markatizaysi aze? Ne aazas duuna zariki?” gidi Yesusa oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesusay isstas aykokka zaronta coo7u gidees. Qessista halaqay qassekka “Anjetida Xoossa nay kirstosay nene?” gi oychidees. <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesusaykka zaridi “Ee tanank, asa nay woqama Xoossa ushachana utishininne salo sharara yishin inte iza beyana” gides. <verse number="63" style="v"/>Qessista halaqay ba mayo dakidi “Nuss hara aza marka koshize? <verse number="64" style="v"/>Izi casha qaala Xoossa bolla hasa7ishin inte siyidista ha7ich intes ay milatizee?” gides. Istika izas hayqoy beses giidi wurikka issi qalan pirdida. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Hessa wode issi issi asati iza bolla cuchu cutida, iza ayfe goozi oykidi icishe “anne buro hananaysa yoota” gida. Bagayti qasse shagalan baqishe efida.</para>
  <para style="s">Phixrosay Yesusa kadidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Phixirosay duge bagara hen gibbe gidon dishin qesista halaqa garadistappe issiniya yadaus. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Phixirosay tama ho7ishin tish hista xeladane “Neni Nazirete Yesusara dasa gidikki?” gadus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Izi qass “Ne gizaysade ta erikke, ne gizays tass gelena” gidi kadidees. Hessafe gede penge poqi eeqi dishin herakka kutoy wasidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>He garadeya iza be7idamala hen eeqida asatas “Haysi adezi izara diza asatappe issadekko!” gada qassekka hasa7adus. <verse number="70" style="v"/>Izi qassekka kadides. Gutha wode gamm7ishin hen eqida asati Phixirossa “Neni Galila asa, hessa gish tummappe ne isstappe issade” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Gido atin izi qass “inte gizade ta erikke” gishe caqonne bena qangeth oykidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Herakka kutoy namm7antho wasidees. Phixirosaykka “kutoy namm7a wasanas ne tana hedza kadana” gida Yesusa qalay izas qopetin hiqumidi yekides.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusa Philaxosakko Efida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Malado wontara qessista halaqti dere cimatinne Muse woga tamarsizayti kummetha shango alafistara issippe zoretidi Yesusa qachi ekki efidi Philaxosas athi immida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Philaxosaykka Yesusa “Ne Ayhudata kawo?” gi ooychidees. Yesusakka “Ee ne gida mala” gidi izas zaridees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Qessista halaqatikka daro yoho iza bolla shisi motida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Philaxosay qass “Ne aazas malthe immikki? Hekko nena daro yon motetes” giidi qassekka oychidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesusay ha7ikka izas aykkoka malthe imonta gish Pilaxosaykka malaletides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paziga ba7ale galas Pilaxosay derey birshana mala oychidade birshi yediza wogay kasse dees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Itta oothon dere bolla dendidi shemppo wodhida asatara issippe qashetida barbane getetiza issadey dees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Dereykka yidi kasse dosse gididaysa izi oothana mala Philaxosa wosidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pilaxosaykka istas “Ta intes Ayhude kawo birshana mala koyetii? gi ooychidees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Philaxosay hessaththo ooychiday kasse qessista halaqati Yesusa qanaten athi immidaysa eriza gishasa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Qessista halaqati qass iza olla Barbaney birsheto gi oychana mala dereza denthethida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Philaxosay “Histikko inte Ayhuda kawo giza adeza wostana mala koyeti” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Issti qassekka “Kaqa kaqa” gi wasida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Philaxosaykka “Ay iita oothide?” gi istta oychidees. Istti qass “Kaqa kaqa” gidi kasseppe athi wasida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Philaxosaykka dereza ufaysana gidi Barbane istas birshides. Yesusa garafidi kaqanas athi immidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Wotadarati Yesusa bolla qilicida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wotadarati Yesusa dere harizaysa gibe ekki bidi atida wotadarata wursi shishida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesusa waga la7o gidida zo7o mayo mayzida; aguntha akilile xaxidi iza hu7en wothida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessappekka “Aayhuda kawo saroy ness gido!” gishe iza sarothida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iza hu7e gufera shocida; iza bollakka cutida gulbatidi izas goynida. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iza bolla qidhi ka7idappe guye kasse mayzida zo7o mayoza qari ekidi kase iza mayoza zari mayzidi kaqanaso eki bida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa kaqeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Alakisandrosanne Rufosa aawa Simmona getetiza issi qarena dere assi dereppe katama yizaysa Yesusa masqale wolqara ooyki tosida. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessafe Yesusa izas birshechay “asa hu7e guge” Golgothu getetizaso efida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Karbe getetiza dhalera walaketida woynne caje uuyana mala izas immin izi ekonta ixidees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe guye iza kaqida, iza mayo issade issade awaysa gakanakone gidi sama yegidi gishetida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Issti iza kaqishin wonappe hezu saatte gididees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Isstti masqale bolla xafi shishida moto qalay “Aayhude kawo” giza qaala. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izara issippe namm7u pangata issa izappe ushachara issa hadirsara kaqida. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Heesankka kasse maxafay “Ittatara issippe taybetidees” gida tinbite qalay poletidees. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ooggera adhi bizaytikka ba hu7e qathishe “Oy! oy! maqidasse lalada hezu galasan kexanay nene?” gidi pala cashe cayishe; <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Anne ha7i masqale bollappe wodhada nena asha” gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hesathokka Qessista halaqatinne Muse woga tamarsizayti ba garsan issay issas “harata ashidees shin bena ashana danda7ibeyna” gidi iza qidhida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nu iza beydi amanana mala anne haysi kirsotosay Isra7elista kawoy ha7i masqaleppe wodho” gida. Izara kaqetidaytikka iza bolla cashe korida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusa Hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Usuppun satteppe oykidi uudufun sate gakaans biittay wuri dhumidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Uddufun satte bolla Yesusay “Eelohe eelohe lama sabaqitani?” gidi qaala dhoqu histidi wasidees. Hessas birshechay “Ta Xoosso Xoosso ne tana aazas agadi” gussa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hen gadan eqida asappe issi issi asati hessa siyidi “Eelasa xeygesikko” gida. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hesappe issi uray eleli bidi calida woynne caje isponje mala mishan gelithi kessidi miththa xeran qaphidi uuyana mala Yesusas shishidees. Hessafe qasse “Anne agagitte Elasay yidi iza kaqoppe wothishin nu beynna” gidees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">calia woyne caje kaqetida assi ba waye balana mala othes.</char></note> <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hessafe Yesusay qaala dhoqu histi wasidi shempo kezides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Meqidase magalasha pude hu7era duge namm7u kezi daketidees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesusa ginara eqida issi xeetu wotadara halaqay Yesusay hessaththo gita qalara wasidi shemppo kezishi beydi “Haysadey tummu Xoossa nakoshin” gidees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessa wode macashati hanizaysa hahon didi xeleida. Issta gidoppe Magidaleppe yida Maramane natiza Yaqobene Yossa aayo Maramira qassekka Solomira issippe deetes. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Heyti macashati Galilan Yesusa kalishene izas othishe gamm7idayta. Istarakka issippe hara daro macashati Yerusalame bida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wodey qami qami bishin Sanbatas gigetiza galasi gakidees. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Dere cimata garsan bonchetida issi Armata ass Yosefo getetizaysi Xoossa kawoteth nagishe dizadey babonta Philaxossakko bidi Yesusa anha wosidees. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Philaxosaykka izi hini wode elera hayqidaysa siyidi malaletidees. Xeetu wotadarata halaqa xeygidi izi hayqin woqa wodekkonne ooychidees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Izi hayqidaysa xeetu wotadarata halaqay geshi eridappe guye Yesusa anha Yosefos immidees. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yosefoykka mogo mayo shamidi anha masqaleppe wothidi mogo mayon xaxidi shuchappe wocetida dufon wothidees. Duhaaththaa dunna shuchara tucidees. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Magidaleppe yida Maramirane Yossa ayo Maramra Yesusa anha awan mogidakkon beyida.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesusay Hayqoppe dendidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sanbatay adhidappe guye Magidale Marama Yaqobe aayo Maramira Salomira issippe bidi Yesusa anha tiyanas shito shamida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Samintafe koyro galas malado wontara buro awa arshey kezida mala Yesusa dufokk buro bishin <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Dufoza dunappe shucha nuss ooni gendersanee?” gidi ba garsan hasa7etida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Issti dhoqu gi xelishin daro gitta shuchay dufoza dunappe genderidaysa beyida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gede dufoza giddo gelida mala issi botha mayo mayida panthi ushacha bagara utidaysa beyidi dagamida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Izi qass istas “Dagamopitte inte kaqetida Nazirete Yesusa koyista, izi dendidees han deena, issti iza wothidaso hayssa beyte” gidees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gido atin inte biidi iza kalizaytasine Phixirosas kasse intes yotida mala inteppe kasetidi izi Galila bana. Inte iza hen demana gidi istas yotitte gidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Macashatikka malaletishene kokorishe dufappe kezi baqatida. Babida gish oonasikka aykkokka qatibeytena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Samintappe koyro galas Wogga wonta maladora izi hayqoppe dendidappe guye Yesusay izippe lappun daydanth kesida Magidale Maramis koyro betides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Izakka bada kasse izara dizayti muzotishenne yekishe dishin demada yotadus. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Isti Yesusay paxa dizaysanne iza ta iza beyadis gidaysa siyidi amanibeytena.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay bena kaliza namm7atas betidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessappe guye iza kalizaytappe namm7ati gede dere gars bishin Yesusay isstas hara ass milati betidees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isstikka simidi hessa iza kalizaytappe atidaytas yotida. Gido atin iza kalizyti siyidi amaibeytena.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay bena kaliza tamane issinistas betidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessappe guye tammane issineti kaththa madan dishin Yesusay istas qoncidees. Izi hayqoppe dendin iza beyida asati isstas yotin siyidi ammanonita agida gish isstas ammanoy bayndaysanne issta wozina mumetetha gish issta borides. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Isstaskka hizgidees “Gede alame wursoso biite, mishracho qaala medhetetha wursoso sabakitte.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Aamanidayne xamaqetiday atana. Amanontay gidikko pirdistana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tana amanizayta hayti malatati kalana. Isti ta sunthan daydanthata kesana, ooratha qalankka hasa7ana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Issti shoshata ba kushera oykkana, wodhiza marzekka uyikoka issta qohena. Be kushe harganchata bolla wothi wossikko haraganchati paxana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesusay pude salo bidees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Goda Yesusay hessa yotidappe gueye pudde salo dendidi bidi Xoossa ushacan utidees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iza kalizayti hessappe kezidi wursoson adhi adhi sabakida. Godaykka isstara oothidees. Issta timirteza ekidi oothizaytas ba yotida qalakka malata othi othi minthidees.</para>
</usx>
